oday I practiced deploying Azure Resource Groups dynamically using Terraform and for_each.

✅ Created Multiple Resource Groups
✅ Used Terraform Variables (tfvars)
✅ Learned Infrastructure as Code (IaC) concepts
✅ Automated Azure resource deployment

🔧 Terraform Code:

resource "azurerm_resource_group" "resource_group" {

  for_each = var.resource_name

  name     = each.key
  location = each.value
}

📂 variables.tf

variable "resource_name" {
  type = map(string)
}

📂 terraform.tfvars

resource_name = {
  rg1 = "eastus"
  rg2 = "westus"
  rg3 = "centralindia"
}

▶ Commands Used:

terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply

This practice helped me understand:
✔ Terraform for_each
✔ Azure Resource Management
✔ Dynamic Infrastructure Deployment
✔ Infrastructure as Code (IaC)
